{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/strensall-range-firing-times","content_id":"c642fff1-a840-4afe-a75d-44a53d7a6c68","description":"Dates and times when Strensall range is being used for live firing.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9577712","isbn":"","title":"Strensall range firing times October 2026","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/strensall-range-firing-times/strensall-range-firing-times-january-2026"},{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9577713","isbn":"","title":"Strensall range firing times November 2026","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/strensall-range-firing-times/strensall-range-firing-times-september-2026"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>As seen in the Security Defence Review, the Army is at heightened readiness due to a new era of threat. This has placed greater demands on the Defence Training Estate across the UK, which is being used for training more regularly and at shorter notice.</p>\n\n<p>As such, the firing time notifications published on Gov.UK have been standardised to show the daily timings for when live-firing is permitted on the UK DTE. This is a change from the previous method of showing when training bookings had been made in advance.</p>\n\n<p>This to ensure safety of all users, as it is not possible to change Gov.UK notifications at short notice. Broadly, the only guaranteed safe times for access are before or after the firing times provided on this page, however there may be exceptional circumstances where extensions have been requested.</p>\n\n<p>If you wish to use the DTE for recreation, please always refer to onsite safety warning signals to understand if the site is safe to access before doing so.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"your-safety\">Your safety</h3>\n\n<div class=\"call-to-action\">\n  <p>Danger - When warning signals are displayed, regardless of the timings, do not cross the range boundary.</p>\n\n  <p>Warning signals are red flags by day and red lamps by night; range boundaries are marked by red and white poles.</p>\n\n  <p>Red flags and red lamps indicate that live firing is taking place within the range boundaries.</p>\n\n  <p>Do not enter the danger area when in use, this could result in loss of life.</p>\n\n  <p>Do not touch any military debris, it may be dangerous. Please note the location (What 3 Words if possible) and inform 24 Hour operations room on 07514 944447 or via the police.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>Learn more about <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/safe-access\">accessing MOD training areas</a>.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/collections/public-access-to-military-areas\">Public access to military areas - GOV.UK</a></p>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Added Strensall November firing times.","public_timestamp":"2026-10-30T16:39:52Z"},{"note":"Added Strensall October firing times.","public_timestamp":"2026-09-24T16:51:45Z"},{"note":"Added Strensall September firing times.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-28T13:58:50Z"},{"note":"Added Strensall July and August firing times.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-29T12:54:33Z"},{"note":"Added Strensall June firing times.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-21T15:45:14Z"},{"note":"Deleted Strensall March firing times and added May.","public_timestamp":"2026-04-28T15:21:26Z"},{"note":"Updated body of document and added Strensall April firing times.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-27T16:42:56Z"},{"note":"Added Strensall March firing times.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-19T16:50:17Z"},{"note":"Added Strensall February firing times and deleted December.","public_timestamp":"2026-01-30T12:36:20Z"},{"note":"Deleted Strensall November firing times and added January 2026.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-18T16:46:27Z"},{"note":"Deleted Strensall October firing times and added December.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-18T15:19:33Z"},{"note":"Deleted Strensall September firing times and added November.","public_timestamp":"2025-10-22T16:20:01Z"},{"note":"Added Strensall October firing times.","public_timestamp":"2025-09-29T09:19:08Z"},{"note":"Added Strensall September firing times.","public_timestamp":"2025-08-20T09:06:30Z"},{"note":"Added Strensall August firing times in HTML.","public_timestamp":"2025-08-08T10:40:12Z"},{"note":"Added Strensall August firing times.","public_timestamp":"2025-07-31T09:12:59Z"},{"note":"Added Strensall firing times for July.","public_timestamp":"2025-07-01T15:19:42Z"},{"note":"Updated Strensall June dates.","public_timestamp":"2025-05-22T15:45:17Z"},{"note":"Updated April and added May firing times for Strensall.","public_timestamp":"2025-04-14T15:23:34Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-03-25T00:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Guidance","emphasised_organisations":["73068a99-7122-4cad-a876-35ca0b0778b4"],"featured_attachments":["9577712","9577713"],"first_public_at":"2025-03-25T00:00:00.000+00:00","political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"guidance","first_published_at":"2025-03-25T00:00:00+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/strensall-range-firing-times","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/strensall-range-firing-times","base_path":"/government/publications/strensall-range-firing-times","content_id":"c642fff1-a840-4afe-a75d-44a53d7a6c68","document_type":"guidance","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-10-30T16:39:52Z","schema_name":"publication","title":"Strensall range firing times","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/strensall-range-firing-times","withdrawn":false}],"children":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/strensall-range-firing-times/strensall-range-firing-times-september-2026","api_url":"http